{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my collection of small games, the kind which you might casually play when you wake up early on a Saturday morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games included so far:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heli - A 2d helicopter flying game where you rescue orphaned &quot;Stompers&quot; from rock-throwing, gun-toting worms. Stompers will stomp grapes to make wine at your base, which you can sell to buy upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More games to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further details:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heli</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572310/extras/db88fb9361e84ff31b1f8c73f7e0bb9a.avif?t=1760369418\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Heli, you fly a helicopter across a procedurally generated terrain, picking up orphaned &quot;Stompers&quot; and grapes to bring back to your base. There, the Stompers will happily stomp your grapes, making barrels of wine which you can sell to buy upgrades for your helicopter and base! Use these upgrades, like enhanced shields and fire rate to take on the worms, who will throw rocks and shoot at your helicopter to take it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heli is at times action-packed, when you have low ammo and are trying to rescue a Stomper from amidst several worms, and at times relaxed as you watch them stomp your grapes back at your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of Heli is to save up enough money to purchase a spaceship, so that you can escape this nasty, worm-infested planet and take the poor Stompers to a new homeworld.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2572310?t=1760369418","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2572310?t=1760369418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572310/c7812bb9ad4eb018228c6926277e3d6d54a918f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760369418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572310/c7812bb9ad4eb018228c6926277e3d6d54a918f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760369418","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Source Code Available</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I program these games from scratch in the C programming language, using only OS platform libraries. The source code for my game framework is in the public domain. The game-specific source code is available as a paid upgrade.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my collection of small games, the kind which you might casually play when you wake up early on a Saturday morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games included so far:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heli - A 2d helicopter flying game where you rescue orphaned &quot;Stompers&quot; from rock-throwing, gun-toting worms. Stompers will stomp grapes to make wine at your base, which you can sell to buy upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More games to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Further details:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heli</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572310/extras/db88fb9361e84ff31b1f8c73f7e0bb9a.avif?t=1760369418\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Heli, you fly a helicopter across a procedurally generated terrain, picking up orphaned &quot;Stompers&quot; and grapes to bring back to your base. There, the Stompers will happily stomp your grapes, making barrels of wine which you can sell to buy upgrades for your helicopter and base! Use these upgrades, like enhanced shields and fire rate to take on the worms, who will throw rocks and shoot at your helicopter to take it down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heli is at times action-packed, when you have low ammo and are trying to rescue a Stomper from amidst several worms, and at times relaxed as you watch them stomp your grapes back at your base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of Heli is to save up enough money to purchase a spaceship, so that you can escape this nasty, worm-infested planet and take the poor Stompers to a new homeworld.</p>","developers":["Croaking Kero"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2572310/bbf79391fce5df4f5afa5c4f7ab9db720da8836f/header.jpg?t=1760369418","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3320<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 100 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15 Sequoia<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 100 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2572310/1090313695/9290e4d38dfe9aab9b994dd3404d20f731cfb0